---

## Critical Patterns
- **Export Fallback:** WebCodecs → MediaRecorder → api.video cloud transcoding
- **Trim Control:** Uses 0–1 ratios (NOT absolute seconds)
- **Panel Timing:** Split by sentence boundaries and silence gaps (>0.5s)
- **Ken Burns:** Runs for full panel duration (not capped at 5 seconds)
- **Transitions:** Occur between panels; duration configurable (slower/normal/faster)
- **Callback Props:** SubtitlePanel/TitlePanel use callback-based props, NOT two-way binding

